PdM Digital Twin — attribution
==============================

This repository implements a **predictive maintenance digital twin** for the
**Microsoft Azure Predictive Maintenance** dataset (`PdM_*.csv`). Requirements
and problem framing follow the bundled technical assignment
(`Technical Interview Assignment.docx`).

Implementation, design decisions, and documentation are **original work by
Saurav Bhowmick** (see `README.md`). Third-party libraries and the public
dataset retain their respective terms; this project is released under the MIT
`LICENSE`.
